# dotnet: NuGet's packages and tools, and the revocation lists of DigiCert, which issues NuGet's
# signing certificates, that NuGet checks each package's signatures against, with DigiCert's OCSP
# responder, which it asks when a list can't be fetched; the SDKs mise installs for a
# global.json's version (the install script at dot.net, the SDK's archive). Microsoft's telemetry
# is left out.
api.nuget.org
crl3.digicert.com:80
ocsp.digicert.com:80
dot.net
builds.dotnet.microsoft.com
